    prompt: "Create a premium seafood restaurant Instagram social media campaign for {브랜드명}.\n\nIMAGE TYPE: Modern seafood advertisement poster, shrimp restaurant Instagram carousel, premium food-commercial social media design.\n\nTOPIC: {메뉴종류}\n\nSTYLE & ART DIRECTION:\n- Fresh seafood advertising aesthetic\n- Orange-and-white restaurant branding\n- Modern casual food-commercial design\n- Instagram carousel campaign style\n- Minimal seafood promotional layout\n- Friendly energetic restaurant branding\n- Behance-quality food advertising\n- Dynamic seafood-product storytelling\n\nMAIN SUBJECT / HERO ELEMENT:\n- Large realistic {메뉴종류} dishes\n- Crispy fried shrimp textures\n- Seafood plates and bowls\n- Floating shrimp elements around layout\n- Golden seafood highlights\n- Wooden serving boards, sauce bowls and garnishes\n- Premium restaurant food styling\n\nLAYOUT & COMPOSITION:\n- Multi-post Instagram grid system\n- Floating shrimp decorations\n- {강조색} geometric overlays\n- Minimal white textured background\n- Strong promotional CTA blocks\n- Large vertical typography\n- Food centered prominently\n\nTEXT & TYPOGRAPHY:\n- Bold playful restaurant typography\n- Rounded uppercase headlines\n- {강조색} promotional text blocks\n- Main text: \"{메인카피}\"\n- CTA: \"{CTA텍스트}\"\n- Brand: \"{브랜드명}\"\n\nDEPTH & LIGHTING:\n- Bright restaurant-commercial lighting\n- Warm appetizing highlights\n- Golden seafood reflections\n- Premium food-photography glow\n\nEXTRA DESIGN DETAILS:\n- Floating shrimp graphics\n- Orange shapes and overlays\n- Sauce splashes, minimal doodle elements\n- Restaurant CTA bars\n- Food crumbs and garnish details\n\nCOLOR PALETTE:\n- Bright {강조색}\n- White, {보조색} accents\n- Golden shrimp tones, warm beige\n\nQUALITY: Behance-quality restaurant campaign, ultra realistic seafood rendering, premium food-commercial branding, ultra high resolution.",
