    story: "flow 총무팀에서 사내 카페테리아 메뉴 사진을 고급 에디토리얼 플랫레이로 변환.\n기존 핸드폰 사진을 AI로 미슐랭급 비주얼로 재구성해 사내 메뉴판에 적용.\n'오늘 메뉴 뭐야?' 대신 '오늘 메뉴 사진 봤어?' 대화가 오가며 직원 만족도 상승.",
    prompt: "Look at the food in this photo. Extract ONLY the main dish and recreate it as a high-end editorial flat lay food poster.\n\nSTEP 1 — ANALYZE:\n- Identify the single hero dish: {요리종류}\n- List ONLY the ingredients visually confirmed inside or on the dish\n- Note the cuisine type: {요리문화권}\n- Carefully observe the exact plate/bowl design: shape, color, rim pattern, material\n\nSTEP 2 — BACKGROUND:\n- Solid flat {배경색} background — NO gradients, NO texture, NO patterns\n- Choose a color that makes the dish POP — high contrast preferred\n\nSTEP 3 — COMPOSITION (strict overhead / flat lay, 90° top-down):\n- Hero dish centered on the exact same plate/bowl from the original photo\n- Plate occupies roughly 40% of frame\n- Surrounding the plate, arrange:\n  • 3–5 raw ingredients pulled STRICTLY from confirmed list\n  • 1–2 small white ceramic bowls with sauces or single ingredients\n  • Small scattered elements: seeds, leaves, powder only — NO sauce drops on background\n- All props cast soft, minimal shadows\n- Negative space visible — background color breathes around elements\n\nSTEP 4 — TYPOGRAPHY:\n- Style: Bold brush calligraphy — {타이포스타일}\n- Placement: Upper left or upper right corner, NOT centered\n- Color: White or darkest shade of background color\n- Content: \"{타이포텍스트}\"\n- Scale: Large enough to be a graphic element\n\nUTENSIL RULES:\n- {요리문화권} dishes → {수저종류}\n- Place utensils on a folded linen napkin in the lower right corner\n\nREALISM RULES:\n- Food imperfections: uneven browning, irregular edges, natural curl/wilt\n- Scattered elements: seeds and dry powder only, uneven clusters\n- Arrangement: items feel hand-placed, NOT mathematically centered\n- All surfaces MATTE or semi-matte — NO plastic-looking shine\n- Must look like professional food photographer shot, NOT AI-generated\n\nSTEP 5 — FINISHING:\n- Small logo box in opposite corner from typography\n- Thin capitals along bottom edge: \"{브랜드텍스트}\"\n- Soft, diffused, even lighting — no harsh shadows\n- Feel: Premium, editorial, calm. Like high-end food magazine.\n\nOUTPUT: One vertical portrait poster, aspect ratio 4:5. Clean. Minimal. Striking.",
